Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:05.820
We are going to be talking about a number
of aspects of a weekend Republican donor event

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:09.300
that took place at Donald Trump's Florida
club.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.010
Doral looks like Dorel to me.

