00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:15.990
We're going to talk.

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:16.990
Yes.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:17.990
About what Donald Trump said.

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:22.380
But really, the relevance of Trump now is
more now that he's out of office.

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:28.660
The relevance is what happens to the followers
